Q("When a licence lapses:", ["Local data is wiped", "The terminal signs out gracefully — nothing is wiped and no queued sale is lost", "The queue is cleared", "Sales continue"], 1, "Renew the licence; the terminal resumes where it stopped.", "Ch3"),
